OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a hearing in February, the
OL,7,Fwoman, who was referred to as Jane,
OL,8,Ftold the judge she had lied about the
OL,9,Fpregnancies for revenge, claiming the
OL,10,Fman had abused her.
